soda-storyboard contains a Python port of all 14 recipes from manga-blueprint-studio.
Upstream files: layout-recipes.mjs (recipe metadata, row weights, width biases,
hero placement and geometry); layout-solver.mjs (reference for candidate affinity
without rearranging reading order); layout-modifiers.mjs (reference only).
Local source snapshots: docs/tasks/refs/manga-blueprint-studio/.
Implementation: src/soda_storyboard/templates.py and recipes.json.

Changes: Chinese names/help, configurable gutters, LTR mirroring, explicit order,
importance-based candidate ranking, seven-panel extensions (except the horizontal
recipe), and deterministic geometry with mutation=0. Seed/mutation, technique
advice, locks, insets, bleed and breakout are not ported. Staggered rectangles
supply the asymmetric composition; no independent diagonal deformation is used.
No kumiko AGPL code is included. Full upstream MIT license follows.

